# DsStatusBadge docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsStatusBadge
  icon="check_circle"
  status="active"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsStatusBadge icon="check_circle" status="active" />;

## Ghost

### Show code
<DsStatusBadge
  ghost
  icon="check_circle"
  status="active"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Ghost = () => <DsStatusBadge icon="check_circle" status="active" ghost />;

## Small

### Show code
<DsStatusBadge
  icon="check_circle"
  size="small"
  status="active"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Small = () => <DsStatusBadge icon="check_circle" status="active" size="small" />;